  "summary": {
    "zh": "尼罗河流域是早期国家、象形文字行政与纪念性王陵建筑的核心考古—历史研究区；本条以前王朝（Naqada）→早王朝→古王国为重点。密度加深后结构化包含多遗址一手报告与可机读主张，事实与假说分栏。",
    "en": "The Nile Valley is a core region for early state formation, hieroglyphic administration, and monumental royal mortuary architecture; this entry centers Predynastic (Naqada) through Early Dynastic and Old Kingdom. After the density pass, the structured pack holds multiple site-level primary reports and machine-readable claims with fact/hypothesis separation."
  },
